Results on UCF-Crime dataset show that VADTree substantially outperforms all <span id="S4.T2.fig1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9D9;"> <span id="S4.T2.fig1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_phantom"><span style="visibility:hidden">Ay</span></span>Training-free </span>, one-class, and unsupervised methods, even surpassing some weakly-supervised approaches.
</span></figcaption>
