<section id="Pt1" class="ltx_part">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_part"><span id="Pt1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_align_center" style="font-size:144%;">VADTree: Explainable Training-Free Video Anomaly Detection via Hierarchical Granularity-Aware Tree
<br class="ltx_break"></span></h2>

<div id="Pt1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt1.p1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="Pt1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:144%;">Technical Appendices</span></p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<div id="Pt1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The appendix begins by detailing the algorithmic process underlying the construction of the HGTree and establishing the proof of its representational completeness. Furthermore, it presents additional experimental details, including extensive ablation studies and comparative analyses. Finally, the appendix examines the limitations of this work and its potential societal impact.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Hierarchical Granularity-aware Tree</h3>

